Note on the imbalance arms
--------------------------
The two imbalance arms were trained on a deliberately reduced subset (14 images for kamyun/minibus/savari/vanet) to exercise the BalancedBatchSampler. Their test scores are not comparable to the full-data arms and cannot be production candidates.

